          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Where the week actually went: coding hours, computer time, and what came of them. One entry per week, accumulated from the <fr:link href="/007S/" title="Weeknotes" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/007S/" display-uri="007S" type="local">weeknotes</fr:link>.</html:p>
